<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>請求書</title>
  <style>
    @page {
      size: A4;
      margin: 15mm;
    }
    
    body {
      font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'Yu Mincho', 'YuMincho', 'Hiragino Mincho Pro', 'MS PMincho', serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      color: #000;
    }
    
    .header {
      text-align: center !important;
      margin: 0 auto 30px auto;
      page-break-after: avoid;
      width: 100%;
      display: block;
      clear: both;
    }
    
    .header h1 {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 0 auto !important;
      padding: 15px 0;
      border-bottom: 3px solid #333;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-align: center !important;
      width: 100% !important;
      display: block;
      position: relative;
      left: 0 !important;
      right: 0 !important;
    }
    
    .header p {
      text-align: center !important;
      margin: 5px auto 0 auto;
    }
    
    .invoice-info {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      width: 100%;
      clear: both;
    }
    
    .invoice-info:after {
      content: "";
      display: table;
      clear: both;
    }
    
    .invoice-info .left {
      width: 48%;
      float: left;
    }
    
    .invoice-info .right {
      width: 48%;
      float: right;
      text-align: right;
    }
    
    .company-header {
      text-align: right !important;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      padding-bottom: 15px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
      width: 100%;
    }
    
    .company-header h3 {
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #333;
      text-align: right !important;
      margin: 5px 0;
    }
    
    .company-header div {
      text-align: right !important;
    }
    
    .invoice-info table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }
    
    .invoice-info th,
    .invoice-info td {
      padding: 3px;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
      font-size: 10px;
    }
    
    .invoice-info th {
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      font-weight: bold;
      width: 30%;
    }
    
    .amount-section {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 15px 0;
      padding: 15px;
      border: 2px solid #333;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
    }
    
    .amount-section h2 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    
    .amount {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #2e7d32;
    }
    
    .details-section {
      margin: 15px 0;
    }
    
    .details-section h3 {
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      padding-bottom: 3px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
    }
    
    .details-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'Yu Mincho', 'YuMincho', 'Hiragino Mincho Pro', 'MS PMincho', serif;
      page-break-inside: auto;
    }
    
    .details-table thead {
      /* ヘッダーの繰り返し表示を無効化 */
    }
    
    @media print {
      .details-table thead {
        display: none !important;
      }
      .details-table thead:first-child {
        display: table-header-group !important;
      }
    }
    
    .details-table tr {
      page-break-inside: avoid;
    }
    
    .details-table tbody {
      page-break-inside: auto;
    }
    

    
    .details-table th,
    .details-table td {
      padding: 6px;
      text-align: left;
      border: 1px solid #333;
      font-size: 9px;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }
    
    .details-table th {
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    
    .details-table .number {
      text-align: right;
    }
    
    .footer {
      margin-top: 15px;
      font-size: 9px;
      color: #666;
      page-break-inside: avoid;
    }
    
    .no-break {
      page-break-inside: avoid;
    }
    
    .page-break-before {
      page-break-before: always;
    }
    
    .page-break-after {
      page-break-after: always;
    }
    
    .company-info {
      margin-top: 15px;
      padding: 10px;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
    }
    
    .company-info h4 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%
    # ローカル変数が渡されているかチェック
    purchase_invoice = local_assigns[:purchase_invoice] if local_assigns.key?(:purchase_invoice)
    purchase = local_assigns[:purchase] if local_assigns.key?(:purchase)
    user = local_assigns[:user] if local_assigns.key?(:user)
    purchase_items = local_assigns[:purchase_items] || []
    total_with_tax = local_assigns[:total_with_tax] || 0
    subtotal = local_assigns[:subtotal] || 0
    tax = local_assigns[:tax] || 0
    
    # 会社情報と銀行情報を直接ローカル変数から取得
    company_name = local_assigns[:company_name] || "株式会社アジアビジネストラスト"
    company_address = local_assigns[:company_address] || "〒104-0061 東京都中央区銀座4丁目6-1 銀座医科ビル3階"
    company_postal_code = local_assigns[:company_postal_code] || "〒104-0061"
    company_tel = local_assigns[:company_tel] || "TEL:03-5904-8148"
    company_email = local_assigns[:company_email] || "Email: abt1@asia-b-t.com"
    company_footer = local_assigns[:company_footer] || "アジアビジネストラスト 事務局"
    registration_number = local_assigns[:registration_number] || "T4210001009156"
    
    bank_name = local_assigns[:bank_name] || "楽天銀行"
    bank_branch = local_assigns[:bank_branch] || "第二営業支店"
    bank_branch_code = local_assigns[:bank_branch_code] || "252"
    bank_account_type = local_assigns[:bank_account_type] || "普通預金"
    bank_account_number = local_assigns[:bank_account_number] || "7747552"
    bank_account_name = local_assigns[:bank_account_name] || company_name
  %>

  <div class="header" style="text-align: center !important; width: 100%; margin: 0 auto;">
    <h1 style="text-align: center !important; margin: 0 auto !important; display: block;">請求書</h1>
    <p style="text-align: center !important; margin: 5px auto 0 auto;">Invoice</p>
  </div>

  <div class="invoice-info">
    <div class="left">
      <h3>請求先</h3>
      <table>
        <tr>
          <th>宛先</th>
          <td><%= user&.invoice_recipient&.name || user&.name || "お客" %> 様</td>
        </tr>
        <% if user&.invoice_recipient&.postal_code.present? %>
        <tr>
          <th>郵便番号</th>
          <td>〒<%= user&.invoice_recipient&.postal_code %></td>
        </tr>
        <% end %>
        <% if user&.invoice_recipient&.address.present? %>
        <tr>
          <th>住所</th>
          <td><%= user&.invoice_recipient&.address %></td>
        </tr>
        <% end %>
        <% if user&.invoice_recipient&.phone.present? %>
        <tr>
          <th>電話</th>
          <td><%= user&.invoice_recipient&.phone %></td>
        </tr>
        <% end %>
      </table>
      
      <!-- 請求書情報を左側に移動 -->
      <h3 style="margin-top: 20px;">請求書情報</h3>
      <table>
        <tr>
          <th>請求書番号</th>
          <td><%= purchase_invoice&.invoice_number || "PUR-#{purchase&.id&.to_s&.rjust(6, '0')}" %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th>発行日</th>
          <td><%= purchase_invoice&.invoice_date&.strftime("%Y年%m月%d日") || Date.current.strftime("%Y年%m月%d日") %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th>支払期限</th>
          <td><%= purchase_invoice&.due_date&.strftime("%Y年%m月%d日") || (Date.current + 30.days).strftime("%Y年%m月%d日") %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th>登録番号</th>
          <td><%= registration_number %></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
    
    <div class="right">
      <!-- 発行者情報とロゴのみ -->
      <div class="company-header">
        <%= wicked_pdf_image_tag "abt_logo.png", style: "height: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;" %>
        <h3 style="margin: 5px 0; font-size: 14px;"><%= company_name %></h3>
        <div style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 15px;">
          <%= company_postal_code %><br>
          <%= company_address %><br>
          TEL: <%= company_tel %><br>
          <%= company_email %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="amount-section">
    <h2>ご請求金額</h2>
    <div class="amount">¥<%= number_with_delimiter(total_with_tax) %>-</div>
    <p>（商品代金）</p>
  </div>

  <% if purchase_items.any? %>
  <div class="details-section">
    <h3>商品明細</h3>
    <table class="details-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>商品名</th>
          <th class="number">数量</th>
          <th class="number">単価</th>
          <th class="number">金額</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <% purchase_items.each do |item| %>
        <tr>
          <td><%= item.product&.name || item.product&.title || "商品名不明" %></td>
          <td class="number"><%= item.quantity %></td>
          <td class="number">¥<%= number_with_delimiter(item.unit_price) %></td>
          <td class="number">¥<%= number_with_delimiter(item.unit_price * item.quantity) %></td>
        </tr>
        <% end %>
        <!-- 合計行を tbody 内の最後の行として配置 -->
        <tr style="background-color: #333; color: white; font-weight: bold; page-break-inside: avoid;">
          <td colspan="3" style="text-align: center; background-color: #333; color: white;">小計（税抜）</td>
          <td class="number" style="background-color: #333; color: white;">¥<%= number_with_delimiter(subtotal) %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr style="background-color: #333; color: white; font-weight: bold; page-break-inside: avoid;">
          <td colspan="3" style="text-align: center; background-color: #333; color: white;">消費税（10%）</td>
          <td class="number" style="background-color: #333; color: white;">¥<%= number_with_delimiter(tax) %></td>
        </tr>
        <tr style="background-color: #333; color: white; font-weight: bold; page-break-inside: avoid;">
          <td colspan="3" style="text-align: center; background-color: #333; color: white;">合計</td>
          <td class="number" style="background-color: #333; color: white;">¥<%= number_with_delimiter(total_with_tax) %></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <% end %>

  <div class="company-info no-break">
    <h4>振込先情報</h4>
    <p>
      <strong>銀行名：</strong><%= bank_name %><br>
      <strong>支店名：</strong><%= bank_branch %><br>
      <% if bank_branch_code.present? %>
      <strong>支店番号：</strong><%= bank_branch_code %><br>
      <% end %>
      <strong>口座種別：</strong><%= bank_account_type %><br>
      <strong>口座番号：</strong><%= bank_account_number %><br>
      <strong>口座名義：</strong><%= bank_account_name %>
    </p>
  </div>



  <div class="footer no-break">
    <p>※ お振込手数料はお客様のご負担でお願いいたします。</p>
    <p>※ ご不明な点がございましたら、上記連絡先までお問い合わせください。</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>